The session failure path is real in the installed SDK: if the token expires during the wait and refresh fails, the 
hook drops the notification after consuming the claim. I also found a way the new test can pass with the fix reverted: 
a list refetch under C’s cookies can remove the A–B DM from B’s cached list, making the separate “still listed” guard 
suppress it.
